  "+1 esqueleto como máximo por nivel (mejora cara)": "+1 max skeleton per level (costly upgrade)",
  "Tienes {0} monedas y {1} en cristales. Las mejoras normales llegan hasta 4★; la infusión elemental es para armas de 3★ o más.": "You have {0} coins and {1} in crystals. Normal upgrades go up to 4★; elemental infusion is for weapons of 3★ or more.",
  "<div class=\"fw\">{0}<div class=\"st\">Arma legendaria: no admite mejoras normales.</div>{1}</div>": "<div class=\"fw\">{0}<div class=\"st\">Legendary weapon: it can't take normal upgrades.</div>{1}</div>",
  "Máximo": "Max",
  " monedas": " coins",
  "<span class=\"st\">Requiere un arma de 3★ o más.</span>": "<span class=\"st\">Requires a weapon of 3★ or more.</span>",
  "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" style=\"border-color:{2}\"><b style=\"color:{3}\">Infundir {4}</b><span>1 cristal (tienes {5}) · el arma queda ligada a este elemento</span></button>": "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" style=\"border-color:{2}\"><b style=\"color:{3}\">Infuse {4}</b><span>1 crystal (you have {5}) · the weapon becomes bound to this element</span></button>",
  "<span class=\"st\">Vence a los Elementales de los tótems para conseguir cristales.</span>": "<span class=\"st\">Defeat the totems' Elementals to get crystals.</span>",
  "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" {2}><b style=\"color:{3}\">{4} {5}{6}</b><span>Añadir cristal (tienes {7}) · con 3 despierta {8}</span></button>": "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" {2}><b style=\"color:{3}\">{4} {5}{6}</b><span>Add crystal (you have {7}) · at 3 it awakens {8}</span></button>",
  "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" {2}><b style=\"color:{3}\">{4} Nv{5} → Nv{6}</b><span>{7} · 1 cristal (tienes {8})</span></button>": "<button class=\"small\" type=\"button\" data-s=\"{0}\" data-el=\"{1}\" {2}><b style=\"color:{3}\">{4} Lv{5} → Lv{6}</b><span>{7} · 1 crystal (you have {8})</span></button>",
